UnitPaymentHubLanes
├── when the owner enables a messenger
│   ├── given the caller is the owner
│   │   └── it emits MessengerEnabled and lets lanes use it
│   ├── given the caller is not the owner
│   │   └── it reverts with OwnableUnauthorizedAccount
│   └── given the messenger is the zero address
│       └── it reverts with PaymentHub_ZeroAddress
├── when the ownership is handed over
│   └── given the new owner has not accepted
│       └── it keeps the old owner
└── when anyone creates a lane
    ├── given a local lane
    │   └── it stores the lane under its id and emits LaneCreated
    ├── given a cross chain lane with an enabled messenger
    │   └── it stores the lane under its id and emits LaneCreated
    ├── given a messenger that was never enabled
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_MessengerNotEnabled
    ├── given a zero token
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_ZeroAddress
    ├── given a zero merchant
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_ZeroAddress
    ├── given a local lane with a destination
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_InvalidLane
    ├── given a cross chain lane without a destination
    │   └── it reverts with PaymentHub_InvalidLane
    └── given a duplicate lane
        └── it reverts with PaymentHub_LaneExists
